# The show's recorded audio is COMMITTED — RULING BI, which amends BA.  It was
# ignored here until the show track was split at the act break: one 134MB file
# could not be pushed at all (GitHub's hard limit is 100MB), and the halves are
# 69.4MB and 70.1MB.  The other two reasons BA gave — off a video, and a
# commercial recording on a repo with Pages on — were the owner's to overrule,
# and he did.  docs/AUDIO.md is the contract and carries the whole reasoning.
#
# Anything ELSE that lands in assets/audio/ is still an accident: the three
# files are named, nothing else is.
assets/audio/*
!assets/audio/README.md
!assets/audio/preshow.mp3
!assets/audio/act1.m4a
!assets/audio/act2.m4a
